      "value": "<p><em>Homebrew: the automated damage roll for the Phoenix Monstrosity Form's \"Shroud of Flame\" aura. Not meant to be cast directly -- scripts/shroud-of-flame.js constructs a temporary copy of this item at the end of each combatant's turn and rolls it against whichever creature ended their turn within 20 feet of the Phoenix, if the aura is currently active. No save, per the real ability text.</em></p><p>A creature that ends its turn within the aura takes 2d6 fire damage.</p>"
